@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra dich vu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc lai trang thai luot nop (bam nhieu lan: received -> processing -> graded) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Tao luot nop thieu du lieu (studentCode / repositoryUrl) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Tao luot nop cho bai tap khong ton tai (bai 99) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. Doc luot nop voi id rong khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR (negotiate) -> 200 OK + connectionId + availableTransports
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub (/hub/submissions thieu s) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. (Bo sung) Nop bai vao bai tap da dong (bai 3) -> 400 Bad Request (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 11. (Bai tap 2) Tao luot nop khong dung https:// -> 201 Created, sau 3s thanh failed
# @name createFailedSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "http://example.com/sv002/signalr"
}

### 12. (Bai tap 2) Doc lai luot nop loi sau 3s -> 200 OK, status = failed
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createFailedSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
